# Founder's Note 0002 — Necessary Architecture

## Observation

A clean architecture is not one that contains everything.

It is one that contains only what is necessary.

## Honest Inspection

Ask:

**"If this component were removed today, would the engineer lose understanding or capability?"**

If the answer is **no**, then it has not yet earned its place.

## Measure of Success

Every component carries its own purpose and contributes meaningfully to the engineer's understanding or workflow.

